      "nameEn": "Alpha 1.37.0",
      "neuEn": "Trader window and new font: Press E at a trader to open a window: your inventory on the left, the trader\u0027s inventory on the right and a trade field in between. Drag an offer into the field, the cost is shown below, and with enough material you confirm the trade. Plus a redrawn hexagon font that is much easier to read.",
