      "nr": 50,
      "nameEn": "Alpha 1.39.0",
      "neuEn": "Bell leap and step up: The bell creature has a new attack: after ringing it crouches and leaps at you, and a golden ring shows where it will land. The landing breaks through any block, so step out of the ring. New: walk into a one block ledge and you step right up. Changed: your guard comes up in front of you instead of to the side, your lives sit on the left above the hotbar and the item name on the right.",
